{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"AstrBot.AstrBotLauncher","latestVersion":"0.3.14","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.6c0e4f64.png","priority":1,"sha256":"6c0e4f64df0860bf10f4b423a344fb7ca563a593fc64551b68d6de76eb45514d","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"AstrBot GUI manager","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/AstrBotDevs/astrbot-launcher/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"AstrBot GUI manager","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/AstrBotDevs/astrbot-launcher/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"AstrBot Launcher is a desktop application designed for graphical management of AstrBot, offering comprehensive features including version downloads, instance management, data backup, and automated Python runtime environment configuration.\n\nFeatures\n- Intrusion-free architecture: Runtime environments and dependencies are managed in independent directories to avoid system pollution\n- Multi-instance visual management: Create, start, stop, and upgrade instances all-in-one\n- Secure backup and recovery: Instance-level backup and restore for enhanced data safety\n- Runtime isolation: Instances run independently, eliminating environment conflicts\n- Desktop-friendly integration: Tray residency, auto-start on boot, ready to use upon installation","name":"AstrBot Launcher","packageUrl":"https://github.com/AstrBotDevs/astrbot-launcher","publisher":"github","publisherUrl":"https://astrbot.app/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/AstrBotDevs/astrbot-launcher/releases/tag/v0.3.14","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","large-language-model","llm"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"图形化管理 AstrBot","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"AstrBot Launcher 是一款用于图形化管理 AstrBot 的桌面应用程序，提供版本下载、实例管理、数据备份以及 Python 运行环境自动化配置等完整功能支持。\n\n功能特性\n- 零侵入架构设计：运行环境与依赖统一在独立目录管理，避免污染系统\n- 多实例可视化管理：创建/启动/停止/升级一站式完成\n- 安全备份恢复：实例级备份与恢复，数据更安心\n- 运行时隔离：实例独立运行，杜绝环境冲突\n- 桌面友好集成：托盘驻留、开机自启即装即用","tags":["人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","聊天机器人","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"AstrBot Launcher is a desktop application designed for graphical management of AstrBot, offering comprehensive features including version downloads, instance management, data backup, and automated Python runtime environment configuration.\n\nFeatures\n- Intrusion-free architecture: Runtime environments and dependencies are managed in independent directories to avoid system pollution\n- Multi-instance visual management: Create, start, stop, and upgrade instances all-in-one\n- Secure backup and recovery: Instance-level backup and restore for enhanced data safety\n- Runtime isolation: Instances run independently, eliminating environment conflicts\n- Desktop-friendly integration: Tray residency, auto-start on boot, ready to use upon installation","name":"AstrBot Launcher","packageUrl":"https://github.com/AstrBotDevs/astrbot-launcher","publisher":"github","publisherUrl":"https://astrbot.app/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/AstrBotDevs/astrbot-launcher/releases/tag/v0.3.14","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","large-language-model","llm"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.3.14/app.json","detailSha256":"c43423a61cd6d87b3c7bd1b3059fed9ae1ed0a0f528cefeca69a13b2d7ee6171","releaseDate":"2026-10-31","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.3.14"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.3.13/app.json","detailSha256":"9ba01d440f14803652e5da7037cd3bb2bb7f40509bce0fcc574a7f59ba3a5733","releaseDate":"2026-10-25","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.3.13"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.3.12/app.json","detailSha256":"e76ae1f975478fd83877d71f59bc855f3a890fa8ab3771538bee7bb6b60d9076","releaseDate":"2026-10-19","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.3.12"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.3.11/app.json","detailSha256":"66ec63b4f379